  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>屬性值加成</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>體型</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>速度</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>選擇一項：<br />(a)選擇一項屬性+2;選擇一項不同的屬性+1 (b)選擇三項不同的屬性+1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">小型/中等</span></p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">30尺</span>；<span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">與你步行速度相同的攀爬速度。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">生物類型 Creature Type。</strong> 你是類人生物。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">體型 Size。</strong> 你的體型爲中型或小型。選擇此種族的時候決定你的體型。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">速度 Speed。</strong> 你的步行速度爲 30 尺，你擁有與你步行速度相同的攀爬速度。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">巧足 Dexterous Feet。</strong> 以一個附贈動作，你能用你的腳操縱一個物件、打開或關上一扇門或容器、或是撿起或放下一個微型物件。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">滑翔 Glide。</strong>當你從至少離地10尺的高度墜落時，你可以用你的反應展開你的翼膜，水平滑行一段等同於你步行速度的距離（其方向由你決定），本次摔落對你造成的傷害變爲0。</span></p><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hadozee Dodge\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">鼯猴堅毅</strong></span><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hadozee Dodge。</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">你血管中流淌的魔法增強了你的天生防禦力。當你受到傷害時，你可以用反應投擲一枚d6。你受到的傷害減少 投擲結果+你的熟練加值 點（最低降至0） 。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />你能使用此特質次數等同於你的熟練加值，完成一次長休後，你重獲全部已消耗的使用次數。</span></p></div></div></div></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">語言 Languages</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />你的角色能夠說、讀和寫通用語和另一種你和 DM 認爲適合該角色的語言。《玩家手冊》提供了一項可供選擇的泛用語言列表。DM 能自由地爲特定戰役從列表中去掉或增加語言。</span></p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">第一批鼯猴人是怯弱的哺乳動物，比家貓大不了多少。爲了躲避體型更大的自然捕食者的獵殺，鼯猴人開始在樹上活動，並進化出像翅膀一樣的翼膜，使它們能夠在樹枝間滑翔。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" /><s style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal\">幾百年前，一位法師帶着一支小型魔法船艦隊訪問了鼯猴人的家鄉世界--亞齊爾（Yazir）。在法師的指導下，學徒們佈置了魔法陷阱，捕獲了幾十個鼯猴人。法師給被捕獲的鼯猴人們餵了一種實驗性的靈藥，使他們身體變大，併成爲有智慧的雙足生物。這種藥水具有副作用，它還增強了鼯猴人們對恐懼的抵抗，因此他們在受到傷害時會更加堅韌。法師原本的計劃是創造出一支由增強後的鼯猴人戰士所組成的軍隊，並銷售給最高的出價者。然而事與願違，法師的學徒們對鼯猴人們產生了越來越多的情感，並最終幫助他們逃脫。學徒和鼯猴人們不得不殺了法師，之後便帶上法師剩餘的實驗靈藥逃走。<br />在解放者的幫助下，鼯猴人回到了他們的家鄉世界，並用靈藥創造了更多的同類。隨着時間的推移，所有的鼯猴人新生兒都擁有了強化鼯猴人的特徵。然後，在幾個世紀前，鼯猴人登上了星空，將亞齊爾可怕的掠食者拋在了身後。</s><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />（注：該段背景文本已被Errata刪除）<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />如今，鼯猴人是有着智慧直立行走生物，他們渴望着躲避那些捕食者，探索其他的世界。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />除了是天生的攀爬好手外，鼯猴人的腳和他們的手一樣靈巧，甚至有能跟其他趾頭相對的腳拇指。他們的胳膊和腿上鬆散地掛着翼膜。當被繃緊時，這些翼膜使鼯猴人能夠滑行。鼯猴人將這些翅膀包裹在自己身上以保持溫暖。</span></p></div><div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Choose one of: (a) Choose any +2; choose any other +1 (b) Choose three different +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Small/Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft., climb equal to your walking speed</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> You are Medium or Small. You choose the size when you select this race.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Dexterous Feet\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Dexterous Feet.</span> As a bonus action, you can use your feet to manipulate an object, open or close a door or container, or pick up or set down a Tiny object.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Glide\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Glide.</span> When you fall at least 10 feet above the ground, you can use your reaction to extend your skin membranes to glide horizontally a number of feet equal to your walking speed, and you take 0 damage from the fall. You determine the direction of the glide.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hadozee Dodge\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hadozee Dodge.</span> The magic that runs in your veins heightens your natural defenses. When you take damage, you can use your reaction to roll a [[/r d6]]. Add your proficiency bonus to the number rolled, and reduce the damage you take by an amount equal to that total (minimum of 0 damage).</p><p>You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus. You regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and one other language that you and your DM agree is appropriate for your character.</p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><p>Hadozees' progenitors were mammals no bigger than housecats. Hunted by larger natural predators, they took to the trees and evolved wing-like flaps that enabled them to glide from branch to branch.</p><p>Today, hadozees are sapient, bipedal beings eager to leave behind the fearsome predators of their homeworld and explore other worlds.</p><p>In addition to being natural climbers, hadozees have feet that are as dexterous as their hands, even to the extent of having opposable thumbs. Membranes of skin hang loosely from their arms and legs. When stretched taut, these membranes enable hadozees to glide. Hadozees wrap these wings around themselves to keep warm.</p></div>",
